# Local CI secrets for `act` (used by the global pre-push hook).
#
#     cp .secrets.example .secrets   # then fill in the value(s)
#
# .secrets is gitignored. NEVER commit it. This file lists names only.

# ── NEEDED LOCALLY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Consumed by golden-scenarios.yml, which is push-triggered and so runs
# under `act push`. Optional: the workflow guards on
# `secrets.GEMINI_API_KEY != ''` and skips the live Gemini eval without
# it (the offline schema-validate gate still runs).
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ── CLOUD ONLY - do NOT put these in .secrets ───────────────────────
# Used only by schedule:-triggered workflows (alert-relay, offsite-backup,
# guard-config-audit, keyless-sa-audit, sql-dryrun-sweep, owner-actions-
# verify). Those never run under `act push`; they execute on GitHub and
# read their values from repo secrets there.
#   ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL
#   OFFSITE_BACKUP_GCS
